msgstr "Cóipeáladh an leid IS chuig an ngearrthaisce."

#: includes/class-admin.php:79
msgid ""
"Could not copy prompt automatically. Select all and copy from the box below."
msgstr ""
"Níorbh fhéidir an leid a chóipeáil go huathoibríoch. Roghnaigh gach rud sa "
"bhosca thíos agus cóipeáil é."

#: includes/class-admin.php:81
msgid "AI prompt (copied to clipboard — or select all and copy manually):"
msgstr ""
"Leid IS (cóipeáilte chuig an ngearrthaisce — nó roghnaigh gach rud agus "
"cóipeáil de láimh):"

#: includes/class-admin.php:82
msgid ""
"Policy page AI prompt (copied to clipboard — or select all and copy "
"manually):"
msgstr ""
"Leid IS don leathanach beartais (cóipeáilte chuig an ngearrthaisce — nó "
"roghnaigh gach rud agus cóipeáil de láimh):"

#: includes/class-admin.php:83
msgid ""
"Prompt ready below — select all (Ctrl+A) inside the box and copy (Ctrl+C)."
msgstr ""
"Tá an leid réidh thíos — roghnaigh gach rud sa bhosca (Ctrl+A) agus cóipeáil "
"é (Ctrl+C)."

#: includes/class-admin.php:80
msgid "All cookies are done! Every cookie has a description."
msgstr "Tá gach fianán réidh! Tá cur síos ar gach fianán."

#: includes/class-admin.php:81 includes/class-admin.php:457
msgid "No cookies registered yet."
msgstr "Níl aon fhianán cláraithe fós."

#: includes/class-admin.php:82 includes/class-admin.php:473
msgid "Remove"
msgstr "Bain"

#: includes/class-admin.php:83
msgid ""
"This will permanently delete all consent log records and statistics. "
"Continue?"
msgstr ""
"Scriosfar go buan gach taifead sa loga toilithe agus na staitisticí go léir. "
"Ar mhaith leat leanúint ar aghaidh?"

#: includes/class-admin.php:84 includes/class-admin.php:1150
msgid "All consent log records and statistics have been purged."
msgstr "Scriosadh gach taifead sa loga toilithe agus na staitisticí go léir."

#: includes/class-admin.php:85
msgid "AI prompt for policy page copied to clipboard."
msgstr "Cóipeáladh an leid IS don leathanach beartais chuig an ngearrthaisce."

#: includes/class-admin.php:86
msgid "CSS template copied to clipboard."
msgstr "Cóipeáladh an teimpléad CSS chuig an ngearrthaisce."

#: includes/class-admin.php:88
#, php-format
msgid "%d known cookie(s) added automatically:"
msgstr "Cuireadh fianáin aitheanta leis go huathoibríoch (%d):"

#: includes/class-admin.php:90
#, php-format
msgid ""
"%d unknown cookie(s) added — please set their category and description "
"below."
msgstr ""
"Cuireadh fianáin anaithnide leis (%d) — socraigh a gcatagóir agus a gcur "
"síos thíos."

#: includes/class-admin.php:91
msgid "Unknown"
msgstr "Anaithnide"

#: includes/class-admin.php:92
msgid "Added — categorize and describe in the table below"
msgstr "Curtha leis — catagóirigh iad agus déan cur síos orthu sa tábla thíos"

#: includes/class-admin.php:94
#, php-format
msgid "%d cookie(s) inferred from detected scripts on your site:"
msgstr ""
"Fianáin a bhfuiltear ag súil leo ó scripteanna a braitheadh ar do shuíomh "
"(%d):"

#: includes/class-admin.php:95
msgid ""
"These cookies are expected from tracking scripts on your site, even when "
"blocked until consent."
msgstr ""
"Táthar ag súil leis na fianáin seo ó scripteanna rianaithe ar do shuíomh, "
"fiú nuair a bhíonn na scripteanna blocáilte go dtí go dtugtar toiliú."

#: includes/class-admin.php:97
#, php-format
msgid ""
"%d browser cookie(s) skipped — found in your browser but no matching script "
"on this site:"
msgstr ""
"Fianáin bhrabhsálaí a fágadh ar lár (%d) — tá siad i do bhrabhsálaí ach níl "
"aon script a mheaitseálann iad ar an suíomh seo:"

#: includes/class-admin.php:481
msgid ""
"%d cookie was automatically added based on tracking scripts detected on your"
" site."
msgid_plural ""
"%d cookies were automatically added based on tracking scripts detected on "
"your site."
msgstr[0] ""
"Cuireadh %d fhianán leis go huathoibríoch bunaithe ar na scripteanna "
"rianaithe a braitheadh ar do shuíomh."
msgstr[1] ""
"Cuireadh %d fhianán leis go huathoibríoch bunaithe ar na scripteanna "
"rianaithe a braitheadh ar do shuíomh."
msgstr[2] ""
"Cuireadh %d fhianán leis go huathoibríoch bunaithe ar na scripteanna "
"rianaithe a braitheadh ar do shuíomh."
msgstr[3] ""
"Cuireadh %d bhfianán leis go huathoibríoch bunaithe ar na scripteanna "
"rianaithe a braitheadh ar do shuíomh."
msgstr[4] ""
"Cuireadh %d fianán leis go huathoibríoch bunaithe ar na scripteanna "
"rianaithe a braitheadh ar do shuíomh."

