#: includes/class-admin.php:494
msgid ""
"No cookie policy page has been selected. Set a Privacy Policy page in "
"Settings → Privacy, or choose a page below."
msgstr ""
"Níor roghnaíodh aon leathanach beartais fianán. Socraigh leathanach don "
"Bheartas Príobháideachais i Socruithe → Príobháideachas, nó roghnaigh "
"leathanach thíos."

#: includes/class-admin.php:502 includes/class-admin.php:705
msgid "Cookie policy page"
msgstr "Leathanach beartais fianán"

#: includes/class-admin.php:505
msgid "— Select a page —"
msgstr "— Roghnaigh leathanach —"

#: includes/class-admin.php:510
#, php-format
msgid "%s (WordPress Privacy Policy)"
msgstr "%s (Beartas Príobháideachais WordPress)"

#: includes/class-admin.php:513
msgid ""
"Defaults automatically to the WordPress Privacy Policy page (Settings → "
"Privacy). Add the shortcode [kncc_cookie_policy] to that page to show the "
"cookie declaration."
msgstr ""
"Mar réamhshocrú, úsáidtear leathanach an Bheartais Príobháideachais i "
"WordPress go huathoibríoch (Socruithe → Príobháideachas). Cuir an gearrchód "
"[kncc_cookie_policy] leis an leathanach sin chun an dearbhú fianán a "
"thaispeáint."

#: includes/class-admin.php:518
msgid "Policy page style"
msgstr "Stíl an leathanaigh beartais"

#: includes/class-admin.php:525
msgid ""
"Controls the styling of the [kncc_cookie_policy] cookie declaration table."
msgstr ""
"Rialaíonn sé stíl an tábla [kncc_cookie_policy] ina bhfuil an dearbhú fianán."

#: includes/class-admin.php:628
msgid ""
"Theme style is the default so the policy page matches your site typography. "
"Switch to Plugin style for strict plugin sizes and colors."
msgstr ""
"Is í stíl an téama an réamhshocrú, ionas go dtagann an leathanach beartais "
"le clóghrafaíocht do shuímh. Athraigh go Stíl an bhreiseáin chun méideanna "
"agus dathanna seasta an bhreiseáin a úsáid."

#: includes/class-admin.php:539
msgid "Preview Policy Page"
msgstr "Réamhamharc ar an leathanach beartais"

#: includes/class-admin.php:546
msgid "Generate cookie policy page content with AI"
msgstr "Gin ábhar don leathanach beartais fianán le hintleacht shaorga"

#: includes/class-admin.php:548
msgid ""
"Copy the prompt below and paste it into an AI tool. It will generate a "
"complete cookie and privacy policy page in your site language. The cookie "
"declaration will be handled automatically by the [kncc_cookie_policy] "
"shortcode. Paste the generated HTML into your policy page."
msgstr ""
"Cóipeáil an leid thíos agus greamaigh in uirlis IS í. Ginfidh sí leathanach "
"iomlán beartais fianán agus príobháideachais i dteanga do shuímh. "
"Láimhseálfaidh an gearrchód [kncc_cookie_policy] an dearbhú fianán go "
"huathoibríoch. Greamaigh an HTML a ghintear i do leathanach beartais."

#: includes/class-admin.php:552
msgid "Copy AI Prompt for Policy Page"
msgstr "Cóipeáil an leid IS don leathanach beartais"

#: includes/class-admin.php:565
msgid "Detected integrations"
msgstr "Comhtháthuithe a braitheadh"

#: includes/class-admin.php:692
msgid ""
"Active — Site Kit sets consent defaults for its own regions. This plugin "
"sets a denied default for all other visitors and sends consent updates."
msgstr ""
"Gníomhach — socraíonn Site Kit réamhshocruithe toilithe dá réigiúin féin. "
"Socraíonn an breiseán seo toiliú diúltaithe mar réamhshocrú do gach "
"cuairteoir eile agus seolann sé nuashonruithe toilithe."

#: includes/class-admin.php:575
msgid ""
"Active — Site Kit consent mode not enabled. This plugin handles all consent "
"signals."
msgstr ""
"Gníomhach — níl Consent Mode cumasaithe in Site Kit. Láimhseálann an "
"breiseán seo gach comhartha toilithe."

#: includes/class-admin.php:586
msgid ""
"Active — consent status is shared with other plugins via the WP Consent API."
msgstr ""
"Gníomhach — roinntear stádas an toilithe le breiseáin eile trí WP Consent "
"API."

#: includes/class-admin.php:598 includes/class-admin.php:712
msgid "Google Consent Mode v2"
msgstr "Google Consent Mode v2"

#: includes/class-admin.php:602
msgid ""
"Enable Consent Mode v2 (outputs consent defaults in &lt;head&gt; before GTM)"
msgstr ""
"Cumasaigh Consent Mode v2 (cuirtear réamhshocruithe toilithe in &lt;head&gt; "
"roimh GTM)"

#: includes/class-admin.php:610
msgid ""
"Forced on because Google Site Kit is active. Consent Mode is required for "
"Site Kit to receive consent signals."
msgstr ""
"Ar siúl go héigeantach toisc go bhfuil Google Site Kit gníomhach. Tá Consent "
"Mode riachtanach chun go bhfaighidh Site Kit comharthaí toilithe."

#: includes/class-admin.php:614
msgid ""
"Consent Mode tells Google tags what the visitor has allowed (for example "
"analytics or ads). This plugin sends a denied-by-default signal before tags "
"run, and sends an updated signal after the visitor chooses. It controls "
"consent signals only: you still need to install GTM/GA scripts separately."
msgstr ""
"Insíonn Consent Mode do chlibeanna Google cad a cheadaigh an cuairteoir (mar "
"shampla anailísíocht nó fógraí). Seolann an breiseán seo comhartha "
"diúltaithe mar réamhshocrú sula ritheann na clibeanna, agus seolann sé "
"comhartha nuashonraithe nuair a roghnaíonn an cuairteoir. Ní rialaíonn sé "
"ach comharthaí toilithe: caithfidh tú scripteanna GTM/GA a shuiteáil ar "
"leithligh fós."

#: includes/class-admin.php:740
msgid ""
"Site Kit sets consent defaults for its own regions. This plugin adds a "
"denied default for all other visitors and sends each visitor's choice as a "
"consent update."
msgstr ""
"Socraíonn Site Kit réamhshocruithe toilithe dá réigiúin féin. Cuireann an "
"breiseán seo toiliú diúltaithe mar réamhshocrú leis do gach cuairteoir eile, "
"agus seolann sé rogha gach cuairteora mar nuashonrú toilithe."

#: includes/class-admin.php:630
msgid "Need Google Analytics 4 or Google Tag Manager?"
msgstr "An bhfuil Google Analytics 4 nó Google Tag Manager uait?"

#: includes/class-admin.php:633
msgid ""
"We recommend installing Google Site Kit — Google's official WordPress "
"plugin. It sets up GA4 and GTM in a few clicks, and works seamlessly with "
"Kansleri Cookie Consent: Consent Mode v2 signals are handled automatically, "
"with no double-loading or conflicts."
msgstr ""
"Molaimid Google Site Kit a shuiteáil — breiseán oifigiúil WordPress ó "
"Google. Socraíonn sé GA4 agus GTM le cúpla cliceáil, agus oibríonn sé go "
"réidh le Kansleri Cookie Consent: láimhseáiltear comharthaí Consent Mode v2 "
"go huathoibríoch, gan luchtú dúbailte ná coimhlintí."

#: includes/class-admin.php:638
msgid "Install Google Site Kit"
msgstr "Suiteáil Google Site Kit"

#: includes/class-admin.php:649
msgid "Consent Mode defaults (auto-injected in &lt;head&gt;)"
msgstr ""
"Réamhshocruithe Consent Mode (curtha isteach go huathoibríoch in "
"&lt;head&gt;)"

#: includes/class-admin.php:673
msgid "Installation guide"
msgstr "Treoir suiteála"

#: includes/class-admin.php:675
msgid "Activate the plugin and open Settings > Cookie Consent."
msgstr "Gníomhachtaigh an breiseán agus oscail Socruithe > Toiliú fianán."

#: includes/class-admin.php:676
msgid "Configure banner texts, style, and button labels in the General tab."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh téacsanna an mheirge, an stíl agus lipéid na gcnaipí ar an "
"gcluaisín Ginearálta."

#: includes/class-admin.php:677
msgid ""
"Open the Integration tab and enable Google Consent Mode v2 if you use "
"GTM/Google tags."
msgstr ""
"Oscail an cluaisín Comhtháthú agus cumasaigh Google Consent Mode v2 má "
"úsáideann tú GTM/clibeanna Google."

#: includes/class-admin.php:678
msgid ""
"Open the Cookies tab, run Scan Cookies, then review and categorize unknown "
"cookies."
msgstr ""
"Oscail an cluaisín Fianáin, rith “Scan fianáin”, ansin athbhreithnigh agus "
"catagóirigh na fianáin anaithnide."

#: includes/class-admin.php:679
msgid ""
"If unknown cookies are found, an AI helper appears: copy the prompt, paste "
"it into an AI tool, paste the response back into the text box, click Import,"
" then Save Cookies."
msgstr ""
"Má aimsítear fianáin anaithnide, taispeántar cúntóir IS: cóipeáil an leid, "
"greamaigh in uirlis IS í, greamaigh an freagra ar ais sa bhosca téacs, "
"cliceáil “Iompórtáil”, ansin “Sábháil fianáin”."

#: includes/class-admin.php:680
msgid ""
"Confirm the Cookie Policy page in the Policy Page tab — it defaults to the "
"WordPress Privacy Policy page."
msgstr ""
"Deimhnigh an leathanach “Beartas fianán” ar an gcluaisín Leathanach beartais "
"— mar réamhshocrú, is é leathanach an Bheartais Príobháideachais i WordPress "
"é."

#: includes/class-admin.php:681
msgid ""
"Use the AI prompt on the Policy Page tab to generate the full cookie policy "
"page content. Paste the generated HTML into your policy page."
msgstr ""
"Úsáid an leid IS ar an gcluaisín Leathanach beartais chun ábhar iomlán an "
"leathanaigh beartais fianán a ghiniúint. Greamaigh an HTML a ghintear i do "
"leathanach beartais."

#: includes/class-admin.php:682
msgid "Review the Script Blocking tab to see which scripts are auto-blocked."
msgstr ""
"Athbhreithnigh an cluaisín Blocáil scripteanna chun a fheiceáil cé na "
"scripteanna a bhlocáiltear go huathoibríoch."

#: includes/class-admin.php:685
msgid "What each option means"
msgstr "Brí gach rogha"

#: includes/class-admin.php:687
msgid "General tab"
msgstr "Cluaisín Ginearálta"

#: includes/class-admin.php:689
msgid "Choose visual placement of the banner (bar, modal, corner)."
msgstr "Roghnaigh cá dtaispeánfar an meirge (barra, dialóg, cúinne)."

#: includes/class-admin.php:690
msgid "Controls the main accent color used by buttons and links."
msgstr ""
"Rialaíonn sé an príomhdhath aiceanta a úsáidtear do chnaipí agus do naisc."

#: includes/class-admin.php:690
msgid "Primary color"
msgstr "Príomhdhath"

#: includes/class-admin.php:691
msgid ""
"Theme style inherits site typography. Plugin style uses strict sizes/colors "
"for consistent readability."
msgstr ""
"Úsáideann stíl an téama clóghrafaíocht an tsuímh. Úsáideann stíl an "
"bhreiseáin méideanna/dathanna seasta ar mhaithe le hinléiteacht "
"chomhsheasmhach."

#: includes/class-admin.php:692
msgid "Customize visible wording in the consent banner."
msgstr "Saincheap an téacs a thaispeántar sa mheirge toilithe."

#: includes/class-admin.php:692
msgid "Heading/Description/Button texts"
msgstr "Ceannteideal/Cur síos/Téacsanna cnaipí"

#: includes/class-admin.php:693
msgid "Lets visitors re-open cookie settings after they close the banner."
msgstr ""
"Ligeann sé do chuairteoirí socruithe fianán a oscailt arís tar éis dóibh an "
"meirge a dhúnadh."

#: includes/class-admin.php:696
msgid "Cookies tab"
msgstr "Cluaisín Fianáin"

#: includes/class-admin.php:777
msgid ""
"Scans browser cookies and infers expected cookies from tracking scripts on "
"your site (even when blocked until consent). Known cookies are auto-mapped "
"to categories."
msgstr ""
"Scanann sé fianáin an bhrabhsálaí agus oibríonn sé amach na fianáin a "
"bhfuiltear ag súil leo ó na scripteanna rianaithe ar do shuíomh (fiú nuair a "
"bhíonn siad blocáilte go dtí go dtugtar toiliú). Cuirtear fianáin aitheanta "
"i gcatagóirí go huathoibríoch."

#: includes/class-admin.php:699
msgid "AI Helper"
msgstr "Cúntóir IS"

#: includes/class-admin.php:699
msgid ""
"Appears after scanning when unknown cookies are found. Copies a ready prompt"
" to paste into an AI tool. After the AI responds, paste the JSON back into "
"the text box and click Import."
msgstr ""
"Taispeántar é tar éis scanadh nuair a aimsítear fianáin anaithnide. "
"Cóipeálann sé leid réidh le greamú in uirlis IS. Nuair a fhreagraíonn an "
"uirlis IS, greamaigh an JSON ar ais sa bhosca téacs agus cliceáil "
"“Iompórtáil”."

#: includes/class-admin.php:700
msgid ""
"Persists current cookie table values to be used in policy output and consent"
" details."
msgstr ""
"Sábhálann sé na luachanna atá i dtábla na bhfianán faoi láthair, le húsáid "
"in aschur an bheartais agus i sonraí an toilithe."

#: includes/class-admin.php:703
msgid "Policy Page tab"
msgstr "Cluaisín Leathanach beartais"

#: includes/class-admin.php:705
msgid ""
"Selects which page is used for cookie policy content generated by shortcode."
msgstr ""
"Roghnaíonn sé an leathanach a úsáidtear don ábhar beartais fianán a ghineann "
"an gearrchód."

#: includes/class-admin.php:706
msgid "AI Prompt for Policy Page"
msgstr "Leid IS don leathanach beartais"

#: includes/class-admin.php:706
msgid ""
"Generates a prompt you can paste into an AI tool to create a full privacy "
"and cookie policy. The generated text will include the [kncc_cookie_policy] "
"shortcode for the cookie declaration section."
msgstr ""
"Gineann sé leid is féidir leat a ghreamú in uirlis IS chun beartas iomlán "
"príobháideachais agus fianán a chruthú. Beidh an gearrchód "
"[kncc_cookie_policy] sa téacs a ghintear, i roinn an dearbhaithe fianán."

#: includes/class-admin.php:707
msgid ""
"If Polylang or WPML is active, each language can have its own translated "
"policy page. If a translation is missing for some language, the default-"
"language policy page is used as a fallback."
msgstr ""
"Má tá Polylang nó WPML gníomhach, is féidir a leathanach beartais aistrithe "
"féin a bheith ag gach teanga. Mura bhfuil aistriúchán ar fáil i dteanga "
"éigin, úsáidtear leathanach beartais na teanga réamhshocraithe mar chúltaca."

#: includes/class-admin.php:707
msgid "Multilingual support"
msgstr "Tacaíocht ilteangach"

#: includes/class-admin.php:710
msgid "Integration tab"
msgstr "Cluaisín Comhtháthú"

#: includes/class-admin.php:712
msgid ""
"A Google framework for privacy-safe tag behavior. Before consent, storage "
"signals are denied; after user choice, signals are updated (for example "
"analytics_storage=granted). This helps GTM/Google tags respect user consent "
"state."
msgstr ""
"Creat de chuid Google a chinntíonn go n-oibríonn clibeanna ar bhealach a "
"chosnaíonn príobháideachas. Roimh thoiliú, diúltaítear do chomharthaí "
"stórála; tar éis rogha an úsáideora, nuashonraítear na comharthaí (mar "
"shampla analytics_storage=granted). Cabhraíonn sé seo le GTM/clibeanna "
"Google stádas toilithe an úsáideora a urramú."

#: includes/class-admin.php:713
msgid "GTM Container ID"
msgstr "Aitheantas coimeádáin GTM"

#: includes/class-admin.php:713
msgid ""
"Your GTM container identifier (for example GTM-N6828NL). It identifies which"
" tag container your site uses. This field is informational in this plugin "
"and does not inject GTM scripts."
msgstr ""
"Aitheantas do choimeádáin GTM (mar shampla GTM-N6828NL). Léiríonn sé cén "
"coimeádán clibeanna a úsáideann do shuíomh. Is le haghaidh eolais amháin an "
"réimse seo sa bhreiseán, agus ní chuireann sé scripteanna GTM isteach."

#: includes/class-admin.php:716
msgid "Script Blocking tab"
msgstr "Cluaisín Blocáil scripteanna"

#: includes/class-admin.php:798
msgid ""
"Tools like Google Analytics are blocked automatically when added through "
"WordPress plugins (e.g. Google Site Kit)."
msgstr ""
"Blocáiltear uirlisí ar nós Google Analytics go huathoibríoch nuair a "
"chuirtear leis iad trí bhreiseáin WordPress (m.sh. Google Site Kit)."

#: includes/class-admin.php:799 includes/class-admin.php:1071
msgid "Custom Code blocking"
msgstr "Blocáil cóid shaincheaptha"

#: includes/class-admin.php:799
msgid ""
"Stops tracking pasted into Bricks, Elementor, or similar Custom Code fields "
"until the visitor gives consent."
msgstr ""
"Stopann sé rianú a ghreamaítear i réimsí cóid shaincheaptha in Bricks, in "
"Elementor nó in uirlisí cosúla go dtí go dtugann an cuairteoir toiliú."

#: includes/class-admin.php:719
msgid "Video embeds from YouTube and Vimeo are automatically blocked until the visitor accepts marketing cookies. A message with an accept button is shown instead. When the visitor has already consented, videos load normally."
msgstr ""
"Blocáiltear físeáin leabaithe ó YouTube agus Vimeo go huathoibríoch go dtí "
"go nglacann an cuairteoir le fianáin mhargaíochta. Taispeántar "
"teachtaireacht le cnaipe glactha ina n-ionad. Má thug an cuairteoir toiliú "
"cheana, luchtaítear na físeáin mar is gnách."

#: includes/class-admin.php:719
msgid "YouTube & Vimeo iframe blocking"
msgstr "Blocáil iframe YouTube & Vimeo"

#: includes/class-admin.php:722
msgid "Statistics tab"
msgstr "Cluaisín Staitisticí"

#: includes/class-admin.php:724
msgid "Consent statistics"
msgstr "Staitisticí toilithe"

#: includes/class-admin.php:724
msgid ""
"Shows how many visitors accepted, rejected, or customized cookies over 7, "
"30, or 90 day periods. Data is aggregated and anonymous — no personal data "
"is stored."
msgstr ""
"Taispeánann sé cé mhéad cuairteoir a ghlac le fianáin, a dhiúltaigh dóibh nó "
"a shaincheap iad thar thréimhsí 7, 30 nó 90 lá. Tá na sonraí comhiomlánaithe "
"agus gan ainm — ní stóráiltear aon sonraí pearsanta."

#: includes/class-admin.php:725 includes/class-admin.php:1022
msgid "Consent Log"
msgstr "Loga toilithe"

#: includes/class-admin.php:725
msgid ""
"Individual anonymized consent records for GDPR audit compliance. Records "
"contain a hashed visitor identifier, the consent choice, accepted "
"categories, and the policy version. Records are automatically purged after "
"13 months."
msgstr ""
"Taifid toilithe aonair, anaithnidithe, le haghaidh iniúchtaí comhlíonta "
"RGCS. Tá iontu aitheantóir cuairteora haiseáilte, an rogha toilithe, na "
"catagóirí a glacadh, agus leagan an bheartais. Scriostar na taifid go "
"huathoibríoch tar éis 13 mhí."

#: includes/class-admin.php:726
msgid "Downloads all consent log records as a CSV file for auditing."
msgstr ""
"Íoslódálann sé gach taifead sa loga toilithe mar chomhad CSV le haghaidh "
"iniúchta."

#: includes/class-admin.php:726 includes/class-admin.php:1038
msgid "Export CSV"
msgstr "Easpórtáil CSV"

#: includes/class-admin.php:727
msgid "Permanently deletes all consent log records and aggregate statistics."
msgstr ""
"Scriosann sé go buan gach taifead sa loga toilithe agus na staitisticí "
"comhiomlána."

#: includes/class-admin.php:727 includes/class-admin.php:1039
msgid "Purge All Records"
msgstr "Scrios gach taifead"

#: includes/class-admin.php:730
msgid "Multilingual support (WPML & Polylang)"
msgstr "Tacaíocht ilteangach (WPML & Polylang)"

#: includes/class-admin.php:732
msgid "Per-language banner texts"
msgstr "Téacsanna meirge de réir teanga"

#: includes/class-admin.php:732
msgid ""
"When WPML or Polylang is active, switch to a secondary language in the admin"
" bar and edit General tab settings (saved per language). With WPML String "
"Translation, you can also translate the [kncc_settings]* admin text strings "
"— those are used when no per-language override is saved. Otherwise each "
"language uses its own plugin defaults (English if unsupported). Texts are "
"never copied blindly from the default language."
msgstr ""
"Nuair atá WPML nó Polylang gníomhach, athraigh go teanga thánaisteach sa "
"bharra riaracháin agus cuir socruithe an chluaisín Ginearálta in eagar "
"(sábháiltear iad do gach teanga ar leith). Le WPML String Translation, is "
"féidir leat teaghráin téacs riaracháin [kncc_settings]* a aistriú freisin — "
"úsáidtear iad sin nuair nach bhfuil aon sárú sábháilte don teanga. Seachas "
"sin, úsáideann gach teanga a réamhshocruithe breiseáin féin (Béarla mura "
"dtacaítear leis an teanga). Ní chóipeáiltear téacsanna riamh go dall ón "
"teanga réamhshocraithe."

#: includes/class-admin.php:733
msgid ""
"Cookie names, categories, providers, and durations are shared across all "
"languages. Only the description field can be translated per language. Switch"
" language and edit descriptions in the Cookies tab."
msgstr ""
"Roinntear ainmneacha, catagóirí, soláthraithe agus faid na bhfianán idir na "
"teangacha go léir. Ní féidir ach réimse an chur síos a aistriú de réir "
"teanga. Athraigh an teanga agus cuir an cur síos in eagar ar an gcluaisín "
"Fianáin."

#: includes/class-admin.php:733
msgid "Per-language cookie descriptions"
msgstr "Cur síos ar fhianáin de réir teanga"

#: includes/class-admin.php:734
msgid ""
"Banner style, colors, and policy page can be set per language. Non-text "
"settings fall back to the default language; banner texts use per-language "
"overrides, WPML String Translation, or each language's own defaults."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir stíl an mheirge, na dathanna agus an leathanach beartais a shocrú "
"de réir teanga. Úsáideann socruithe nach téacs iad socruithe na teanga "
"réamhshocraithe mar chúltaca; úsáideann téacsanna an mheirge sáruithe don "
"teanga, WPML String Translation, nó réamhshocruithe gach teanga féin."

#: includes/class-admin.php:734
msgid "Per-language settings"
msgstr "Socruithe de réir teanga"

#: includes/class-admin.php:735
msgid "AI prompts"
msgstr "Leideanna IS"

#: includes/class-admin.php:735
msgid ""
"AI prompts for cookie descriptions and policy pages are automatically "
"generated in the language matching the current admin locale."
msgstr ""
"Gintear leideanna IS do chur síos ar fhianáin agus do leathanaigh bheartais "
"go huathoibríoch sa teanga a mheaitseálann logchaighdeán reatha an "
"riaracháin."

#: includes/class-admin.php:738
msgid "Shortcodes"
msgstr "Gearrchóid"

#: includes/class-admin.php:740
msgid "Displays the full cookie declaration table on your policy page."
msgstr ""
"Taispeánann sé tábla iomlán an dearbhaithe fianán ar do leathanach beartais."

#: includes/class-admin.php:741
msgid ""
"Renders a link that opens the cookie settings dialog. Use in footers, menus,"
" or widgets. Customize the link text with the text attribute, e.g. "
"[kncc_cookie_settings text=\"Manage cookies\"]."
msgstr ""
"Taispeánann sé nasc a osclaíonn socruithe na bhfianán. Úsáid é i mbuntásca, "
"i roghchláir nó i ngiuirléidí. Saincheap téacs an naisc leis an aitreabúid "
"text, m.sh. [kncc_cookie_settings text=\"Bainistigh fianáin\"]."

#: includes/class-admin.php:744
msgid "Custom CSS"
msgstr "CSS saincheaptha"

#: includes/class-admin.php:748
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Need to fine-tune the look beyond the General tab? Add CSS to %s, your child"
" theme, or a Code Snippets plugin."
msgstr ""
"Ar mhaith leat an chuma a mhionchoigeartú thar a bhfuil ar an gcluaisín "
"Ginearálta? Cuir CSS le %s, le do théama linbh nó le breiseán Code Snippets."

#: includes/class-admin.php:749
msgid "Appearance → Customize → Additional CSS"
msgstr "Cuma → Saincheap → CSS breise"

#: includes/class-admin.php:752
msgid ""
"Copy the template below, uncomment the rules you want to change, save. Every"
" selector the plugin uses is included."
msgstr ""
"Cóipeáil an teimpléad thíos, díthráchtaigh na rialacha is mian leat a athrú, "
"agus sábháil. Tá gach roghnóir a úsáideann an breiseán san áireamh."

#: includes/class-admin.php:756
msgid "Copy CSS template"
msgstr "Cóipeáil an teimpléad CSS"

#: includes/class-admin.php:828
msgid "Tips:"
msgstr "Noda:"

#: includes/class-admin.php:830
msgid ""
"If a rule does not apply, prepend .kncc-banner or add !important — your CSS "
"file loads after the plugin's, but theme styles can occasionally beat it on "
"specificity."
msgstr ""
"Mura gcuirtear riail i bhfeidhm, cuir .kncc-banner roimpi nó cuir !important "
"léi — luchtaítear do chomhad CSS tar éis CSS an bhreiseáin, ach uaireanta "
"sáraíonn stíleanna an téama é mar gheall ar shainiúlacht."

#: includes/class-admin.php:831
msgid ""
"When General → Text and font style is set to Plugin style, typography rules "
"use !important. Switch to Theme style for easier overrides."
msgstr ""
"Nuair atá Ginearálta → Stíl téacs agus cló socraithe ar Stíl an bhreiseáin, "
"úsáideann na rialacha clóghrafaíochta !important. Athraigh go Stíl an téama "
"chun sáruithe a dhéanamh níos éasca."

#: includes/class-admin.php:832
msgid ""
"Banner z-index is 999999 and the floating button is 999998 — raise them if "
"your theme renders overlays on top of the banner."
msgstr ""
"Tá z-index 999999 ag an meirge agus 999998 ag an gcnaipe ar snámh — ardaigh "
"iad má thaispeánann do théama forleagain os cionn an mheirge."

#: includes/class-admin.php:835
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "Fabhtcheartú"

#: includes/class-admin.php:837
msgid ""
"If GTM Preview does not show consent updates, verify Consent Mode v2 is "
"enabled and test in a fresh browser session without existing consent cookie."
msgstr ""
"Mura dtaispeánann réamhamharc GTM nuashonruithe toilithe, deimhnigh go "
"bhfuil Consent Mode v2 cumasaithe agus déan tástáil i seisiún brabhsálaí nua "
"nach bhfuil fianán toilithe ann cheana."

#: includes/class-admin.php:838
msgid ""
"If banner typography looks odd with your theme, switch General > Text and "
"font style to Plugin style."
msgstr ""
"Má bhíonn cuma aisteach ar chlóghrafaíocht an mheirge le do théama, athraigh "
"Ginearálta > Stíl téacs agus cló go Stíl an bhreiseáin."

#: includes/class-admin.php:839
msgid ""
"If tracking still runs before consent, make sure Custom Code blocking is "
"checked on the Script Blocking tab."
msgstr ""
"Má ritheann rianú fós roimh thoiliú, cinntigh go bhfuil Blocáil cóid "
"shaincheaptha ticeáilte ar an gcluaisín Blocáil scripteanna."

#: includes/class-admin.php:840
msgid ""
"If the statistics are empty, make sure visitors have interacted with the "
"banner. Data starts recording after the first consent choice."
msgstr ""
"Má tá na staitisticí folamh, cinntigh gur úsáid cuairteoirí an meirge. "
"Tosaíonn taifeadadh na sonraí tar éis an chéad rogha toilithe."

#: includes/class-admin.php:841
msgid ""
"If the policy page warning shows missing translations, create the translated"
" page in each language and add the [kncc_cookie_policy] shortcode."
msgstr ""
"Má léiríonn rabhadh an leathanaigh beartais go bhfuil aistriúcháin ar "
"iarraidh, cruthaigh an leathanach aistrithe i ngach teanga agus cuir an "
"gearrchód [kncc_cookie_policy] leis."

#: includes/class-admin.php:845
msgid ""
"I made this plugin for free because I got frustrated by the existing cookie "
"consent plugins — too much bloat and useless features. If you like it and "
"want to buy me a coffee, you can do it here:"
msgstr ""
"Rinne mé an breiseán seo saor in aisce mar go raibh mé bréan de na breiseáin "
"toilithe fianán a bhí ann cheana — an iomarca ualaigh agus gnéithe gan "
"úsáid. Má thaitníonn sé leat agus más mian leat cupán caife a cheannach dom, "
"is féidir leat é a dhéanamh anseo:"

#: includes/class-admin.php:873
#, php-format
msgid "%d days"
msgstr "%d lá"

#: includes/class-admin.php:884
msgid "Total responses"
msgstr "Freagraí san iomlán"

#: includes/class-admin.php:888 includes/class-admin.php:903
#: includes/class-admin.php:913
msgid "Accepted all"
msgstr "Glacadh le gach fianán"

#: includes/class-admin.php:892 includes/class-admin.php:909
#: includes/class-admin.php:915
msgid "Rejected all"
msgstr "Diúltaíodh do gach fianán"

#: includes/class-admin.php:896 includes/class-admin.php:906
#: includes/class-admin.php:914
msgid "Custom selection"
msgstr "Rogha shaincheaptha"

#: includes/class-admin.php:920
msgid ""
"No consent data recorded yet. Statistics will appear after visitors start "
"interacting with the cookie banner."
msgstr ""
"Níl aon sonraí toilithe taifeadta fós. Beidh staitisticí le feiceáil nuair a "
"thosóidh cuairteoirí ag úsáid an mheirge fianán."

#: includes/class-admin.php:937
#, php-format
msgid "Cron error: %s"
msgstr "Earráid cron: %s"

#: includes/class-admin.php:955
msgid "All systems are good!"
msgstr "Tá gach rud i gceart!"

#: includes/class-admin.php:957
msgid "The plugin re-checks cookies every day via cron."
msgstr "Seiceálann an breiseán na fianáin arís gach lá trí cron."

#: includes/class-admin.php:962
#, php-format
msgid "Next check: %s"
msgstr "An chéad seiceáil eile: %s"

#: includes/class-admin.php:1075
msgid ""
"Also block tracking added in Bricks, Elementor, or other Custom Code fields"
msgstr ""
"Blocáil freisin rianú a chuirtear i réimsí cóid shaincheaptha in Bricks, in "
"Elementor nó in uirlisí eile"

#: includes/class-admin.php:1094
msgid "Save blocking settings"
msgstr "Sábháil socruithe blocála"

#: includes/class-admin.php:1099
msgid "Recognized tracking tools"
msgstr "Uirlisí rianaithe aitheanta"

#: includes/class-admin.php:1106
msgid "Script Handle"
msgstr "Láimhseán scripte"

#: includes/class-admin.php:1024
msgid ""
"Individual consent records for GDPR audit compliance. Records are "
"automatically purged after the retention period (13 months)."
msgstr ""
"Taifid toilithe aonair le haghaidh iniúchtaí comhlíonta RGCS. Scriostar na "
"taifid go huathoibríoch tar éis na tréimhse coinneála (13 mhí)."

#: includes/class-admin.php:1028
msgid "Total records:"
msgstr "Taifid san iomlán:"

#: includes/class-admin.php:1030
msgid "Oldest:"
msgstr "An ceann is sine:"

#: includes/class-admin.php:1033
msgid "Newest:"
msgstr "An ceann is nuaí:"

#: includes/class-admin.php:1043
msgid "No consent log records yet."
msgstr "Níl aon taifead sa loga toilithe fós."

#: includes/class-admin.php:1048
msgid "Date/Time"
msgstr "Dáta/Am"

#: includes/class-admin.php:1049
msgid "Visitor"
msgstr "Cuairteoir"

#: includes/class-admin.php:1050
msgid "Choice"
msgstr "Rogha"

#: includes/class-admin.php:1051
msgid "Categories"
msgstr "Catagóirí"

#: includes/class-admin.php:1052
msgid "Policy Version"
msgstr "Leagan an bheartais"

#: includes/class-admin.php:1311
msgid "Cookies saved."
msgstr "Sábháladh na fianáin."

#: includes/class-consent.php:135
msgid "Cookie consent"
msgstr "Toiliú fianán"

#: includes/class-consent.php:147 includes/class-policy-page.php:27
msgid "Cookie Policy"
msgstr "Beartas fianán"

#: includes/class-consent.php:155
msgid "Close"
msgstr "Dún"

#: includes/class-consent.php:187 includes/class-consent.php:188
#: kansleri-cookie-consent.php:590
msgid "Cookie settings"
msgstr "Socruithe fianán"

#: includes/class-policy-page.php:48
msgid "No cookies have been registered yet."
msgstr "Níl aon fhianán cláraithe fós."

#: includes/class-policy-page.php:58
msgid ""
"These cookies are essential for the website to function and cannot be "
"switched off."
msgstr ""
"Tá na fianáin seo riachtanach chun go n-oibreoidh an suíomh gréasáin agus ní "
"féidir iad a mhúchadh."

#: includes/class-policy-page.php:59
msgid ""
"These cookies help us understand how visitors interact with the website by "
"collecting and reporting information anonymously."
msgstr ""
"Cabhraíonn na fianáin seo linn a thuiscint conas a úsáideann cuairteoirí an "
