#: kansleri-cookie-consent.php:572
msgid ""
"This site uses a cookie consent banner powered by Kansleri Cookie Consent. "
"When you interact with the banner, a cookie named <code>kncc_consent</code> "
"is stored in your browser for up to 1 year. It records your consent "
"preferences (which cookie categories you accepted or rejected) so the site "
"can remember your choice on future visits. No personal data is stored in "
"this cookie."
msgstr ""
"Úsáideann an suíomh seo meirge toilithe fianán faoi chumhacht Kansleri "
"Cookie Consent. Nuair a úsáideann tú an meirge, stóráiltear fianán darb ainm "
"<code>kncc_consent</code> i do bhrabhsálaí ar feadh suas le bliain amháin. "
"Taifeadann sé do roghanna toilithe (na catagóirí fianán ar ghlac tú leo nó "
"ar dhiúltaigh tú dóibh) ionas gur féidir leis an suíomh do rogha a mheabhrú "
"ar chuairteanna amach anseo. Ní stóráiltear aon sonraí pearsanta san fhianán "
"seo."

#: kansleri-cookie-consent.php:573
msgid ""
"The plugin also records anonymous, aggregated consent statistics (how many "
"visitors accepted, rejected, or customized cookies each day) and individual "
"consent log entries for GDPR audit compliance. Consent log entries contain a"
" hashed (non-reversible) visitor identifier, the consent choice, which "
"categories were accepted, and the policy version. No IP addresses, user "
"identifiers, or personal data are stored in plain text. Consent log records "
"are automatically deleted after 13 months."
msgstr ""
"Taifeadann an breiseán freisin staitisticí toilithe gan ainm, "
"comhiomlánaithe (cé mhéad cuairteoir a ghlac le fianáin, a dhiúltaigh dóibh "
"nó a shaincheap iad gach lá) agus taifid aonair sa loga toilithe le haghaidh "
"iniúchtaí comhlíonta RGCS. Tá na nithe seo i ngach taifead sa loga toilithe: "
"aitheantóir cuairteora haiseáilte (nach féidir a aisiompú), an rogha "
"toilithe, na catagóirí a glacadh, agus leagan an bheartais. Ní stóráiltear "
"aon seoltaí IP, aitheantóirí úsáideora ná sonraí pearsanta mar ghnáththéacs. "
"Scriostar taifid an loga toilithe go huathoibríoch tar éis 13 mhí."

