"n-aimsítear a scripteanna rianaithe ar an leathanach baile a thuilleadh. "
"Athbhreithnigh an liosta agus úsáid “Bain na fianáin roghnaithe” chun na "
"taifid nach bhfuil uait a thuilleadh a scriosadh — ní bhaintear aon rud go "
"huathoibríoch."

#: includes/class-admin.php:797
msgid "Current consent status"
msgstr "Stádas reatha an toilithe"

#: includes/class-admin.php:797
msgid ""
"The [kncc_cookie_policy] shortcode shows each category as allowed, denied, "
"or not yet chosen above the Edit cookie preferences button. When WP Consent "
"API is active, a note explains the technical wp_consent_* cookie names used "
"by WordPress plugins."
msgstr ""
"Taispeánann an gearrchód [kncc_cookie_policy] an bhfuil gach catagóir "
"ceadaithe, diúltaithe nó gan roghnú fós, os cionn an chnaipe “Athraigh "
"roghanna fianán”. Nuair atá WP Consent API gníomhach, míníonn nóta na "
"hainmneacha teicniúla fianán wp_consent_* a úsáideann breiseáin WordPress."

#: includes/class-admin.php:806
msgid "WP Consent API sync"
msgstr "Sioncrónú WP Consent API"

#: includes/class-admin.php:806
msgid ""
"When the WP Consent API plugin is active, Kansleri automatically syncs your "
"banner choices to wp_consent_functional, wp_consent_statistics, "
"wp_consent_marketing, and wp_consent_preferences. This lets consent-aware "
"plugins such as Google Site Kit read the visitor's choice. Banner labels "
"(Necessary, Analytics) map to these technical cookie names."
msgstr ""
"Nuair atá an breiseán WP Consent API gníomhach, sioncrónaíonn Kansleri "
"roghanna an mheirge go huathoibríoch le wp_consent_functional, "
"wp_consent_statistics, wp_consent_marketing agus wp_consent_preferences. "
"Ligeann sé seo do bhreiseáin a thuigeann toiliú, mar shampla Google Site "
"Kit, rogha an chuairteora a léamh. Mapáiltear lipéid an mheirge "
"(Riachtanach, Anailísíocht) chuig na hainmneacha teicniúla fianán seo."

#: includes/class-admin.php:939
msgid ""
"If wp_consent_statistics stays deny after Accept all, clear site cookies or "
"test in a private window, hard-refresh (Ctrl+Shift+R), and confirm the WP "
"Consent API plugin is active."
msgstr ""
"Má fhanann wp_consent_statistics ar deny tar éis “Glac le gach fianán”, glan "
"fianáin an tsuímh nó déan tástáil i bhfuinneog phríobháideach, déan "
"athnuachan iomlán (Ctrl+Shift+R), agus deimhnigh go bhfuil an breiseán WP "
"Consent API gníomhach."

#: includes/class-admin.php:746 includes/class-admin.php:854
msgid "Advanced Consent Mode"
msgstr "Consent Mode Ardleibhéil"

#: includes/class-admin.php:750
msgid "Load Google tags before consent, with consent denied"
msgstr "Luchtaigh clibeanna Google roimh thoiliú, le toiliú diúltaithe"

#: includes/class-admin.php:753
msgid "Off (default, Basic Consent Mode): the Google tag is blocked until the visitor accepts analytics cookies, and Google Tag Manager until the visitor accepts analytics or marketing cookies, so Google receives nothing from visitors who have not consented."
msgstr ""
"As (réamhshocrú, Consent Mode Bunúsach): blocáiltear clib Google go dtí go "
"nglacann an cuairteoir le fianáin anailísíochta, agus Google Tag Manager go "
"dtí go nglacann an cuairteoir le fianáin anailísíochta nó le fianáin "
"mhargaíochta, ionas nach bhfaigheann Google aon rud ó chuairteoirí nár thug "
"toiliú."

#: includes/class-admin.php:756
msgid ""
"On (Advanced Consent Mode): the Google tag and Google Tag Manager load "
"right away. Until the visitor accepts, they set no cookies and send Google "
"only cookieless pings, which Google uses to model the missing data. Google "
"Analytics and Google Ads expect this mode, and with Basic mode they can "
"report your consent signals as not active."
msgstr ""
"Ar siúl (Consent Mode Ardleibhéil): luchtaítear clib Google agus Google Tag "
"Manager láithreach. Go dtí go nglacann an cuairteoir, ní shocraíonn siad aon "
"fhianán agus ní sheolann siad chuig Google ach pingeanna gan fhianáin, a "
"úsáideann Google chun na sonraí atá in easnamh a mhúnlú. Tá Google Analytics "
"agus Google Ads ag súil leis an mód seo, agus leis an mód bunúsach is féidir "
"leo a thuairisciú nach bhfuil do chomharthaí toilithe gníomhach."

#: includes/class-admin.php:759
msgid "Only applies while Consent Mode v2 is enabled. Other tracking scripts on the site stay blocked until consent, also those that Google Tag Manager adds (for example a Meta Pixel or LinkedIn in a Custom HTML tag): each waits for its own category, with no changes needed in the container."
msgstr ""
"Ní bhíonn feidhm leis seo ach nuair atá Consent Mode v2 cumasaithe. Fanann "
"scripteanna rianaithe eile ar an suíomh blocáilte go dtí go dtugtar toiliú, "
"fiú iad siúd a chuireann Google Tag Manager leis (mar shampla Meta Pixel nó "
"LinkedIn i gclib Custom HTML): fanann gach ceann acu lena chatagóir féin, "
"gan aon athrú a bheith ag teastáil sa choimeádán."

#: includes/class-admin.php:854
msgid ""
"Off by default. When on, the Google tag and Google Tag Manager load before "
"consent instead of being blocked. Until the visitor accepts, they set no "
"cookies and send Google only cookieless pings."
msgstr ""
"As de réir réamhshocraithe. Nuair atá sé ar siúl, luchtaítear clib Google "
"agus Google Tag Manager roimh thoiliú in ionad iad a bhlocáil. Go dtí go "
"nglacann an cuairteoir, ní shocraíonn siad aon fhianán agus ní sheolann siad "
"chuig Google ach pingeanna gan fhianáin."

#: includes/class-admin.php:863
msgid "You can turn this off on the Script Blocking tab."
msgstr "Is féidir é seo a mhúchadh ar an gcluaisín Blocáil scripteanna."

#: includes/class-admin.php:1136
msgid ""
"Advanced Consent Mode is on (Integration tab): the Google tag and Google "
"Tag Manager load before consent and follow the Consent Mode signals instead "
"of being blocked."
msgstr ""
"Tá Consent Mode Ardleibhéil ar siúl (cluaisín Comhtháthú): luchtaítear clib "
"Google agus Google Tag Manager roimh thoiliú agus leanann siad comharthaí "
"Consent Mode in ionad a bheith blocáilte."

#: includes/class-admin.php:1168
msgid ""
"Block YouTube and Vimeo videos until the visitor accepts marketing cookies"
msgstr ""
"Blocáil físeáin YouTube agus Vimeo go dtí go nglacann an cuairteoir le "
"fianáin mhargaíochta"

#: includes/class-admin.php:684
msgid "More information"
msgstr "Tuilleadh eolais"

#: includes/class-admin.php:823
msgid "Basic Consent Mode: the Google tag waits until the visitor accepts analytics cookies, and Google Tag Manager until the visitor accepts analytics or marketing cookies."
msgstr ""
"Consent Mode Bunúsach: fanann clib Google go dtí go nglacann an cuairteoir "
"le fianáin anailísíochta, agus Google Tag Manager go dtí go nglacann an "
"cuairteoir le fianáin anailísíochta nó le fianáin mhargaíochta."

#: includes/class-admin.php:823
msgid ""
"Advanced Consent Mode: the Google tag and Google Tag Manager load right "
"away with these defaults, and send only cookieless pings until the visitor "
"accepts."
msgstr ""
"Consent Mode Ardleibhéil: luchtaítear clib Google agus Google Tag Manager "
"láithreach leis na réamhshocruithe seo, agus ní sheolann siad ach pingeanna "
"gan fhianáin go dtí go nglacann an cuairteoir."

